Package: combatrefql
Title: Reference-Batch RNA-Seq Batch Correction
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Xiaoyu", "Zhang", role = "ctb"),
    person("Thomas", "Sirchi", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "thomasirchi@gmail.com")
  )
Description: Development package for refactoring the original ComBat-ref
    reference-batch RNA-seq batch-correction implementation. The current
    exported method preserves the original ComBat-ref algorithm; quasi-likelihood
    correction is future work and is not implemented.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
