    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    cli,
    edgeR,
    matrixStats,
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    devtools,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
